{"id":"altrettanto","lemma":"altrettanto","pos":"pron","rank":2525,"glosses":["same to you, you too","as much, as many"],"ipa":"/al.tretˈtan.to/","forms":{"feminine":"altrettanta"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-XANA000-altrettanto.wav","examples":[{"text":"\"Buon anno!\" \"Altrettanto!\"","en":"\"A Happy New Year!\" \"I wish you the same!\"","words":[null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"happy New Year!"]]},{"text":"Lei gioca molto bene a tennis ma io so giocare altrettanto bene.","en":"She can play tennis very well, but I can play as well as she can.","words":[{"g":"she / you (formal)"},{"g":"to play a game","l":"giocare"},{"g":"very / a lot"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"tennis"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"sapere"},{"g":"to play a game"},null,{"g":"well"}]}]}